SUMMARY:Symposium in Celebration of Chiricú Journal
DESCRIPTION:Join this symposium to celebrate the Chiricú (https://schola
 rworks.iu.edu/iupjournals/index.php/chiricu/index) academic journal. Ther
 e will be a virtual presentation with IU alum and scholar\, Norma Alarcó
 n and a presentation by award winning author\, Edgar Gómez.&#160\;Chiric
 ú Journal invites scholarly and creative submissions on any facet of Lat
 inx lives\, literatures\, and cultures. Original scholarship and works of
  art\, poetry\, fiction\, non-fiction essays\, and interviews may be subm
 itted in Spanish\, Portuguese\, Indigenous languages\, French or English.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join this symposium to celebrate the <e
 m><a href="https://scholarworks.iu.edu/iupjournals/index.php/chiricu/inde
 x">Chiricú</a></em> academic journal. There will be a virtual presentati
 on with IU alum and scholar\, Norma Alarcón and a presentation by award 
 winning author\, Edgar Gómez.&#160\;</p><p><em>Chiricú Journal</em> inv
 ites scholarly and creative submissions on any facet of Latinx lives\, li
 teratures\, and cultures. Original scholarship and works of art\, poetry\
 , fiction\, non-fiction essays\, and interviews may be submitted in Spani
 sh\, Portuguese\, Indigenous languages\, French or English.</p>
